# Database backups (pg_dump) — real data, not source; keep the file on disk for
# zip/manual transfer between machines, but don't let it bloat git history.
# No leading slash + slash in the middle would otherwise anchor this to the
# repo root only (backup-db.ps1 actually writes to backend/backups/) — the
# leading **/ makes it match backups/ at any depth.
**/backups/*.dump

